@page
@{ Layout = "_CustomerLayout"; ViewData["Title"] = "Help Centre"; }
@section Styles { <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/customer-account-support.css" asp-append-version="true" /> }
<section class="stage7-intro"><div><p class="customer-eyebrow">Help centre</p><h2>Guidance for every step.</h2><p class="customer-lede">Browse the current portal guidance and reach Firmlon support when approved product articles are available.</p></div><span class="customer-status-badge"><span></span>Articles unavailable</span></section>
<div class="stage7-grid"><section class="stage7-panel"><div class="stage7-panel-head"><div><h3>Find an answer</h3><p>Search is ready for an approved article catalogue.</p></div></div><div class="stage7-panel-body"><div class="stage7-search"><label class="sr-only" for="help-search">Search help articles</label><input id="help-search" type="search" placeholder="Search help articles" disabled aria-describedby="help-search-status" /><button class="customer-button customer-button-secondary stage7-disabled" type="button" disabled aria-describedby="help-search-status">Search</button></div><p id="help-search-status" class="stage7-unavailable-label">Help search is unavailable until approved articles are connected.</p><div class="stage7-state"><div class="stage7-state-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-4-4"/></svg></div><div><strong>Approved help content is not connected</strong><p>Unverified hardware specifications, setup steps, safety instructions, and troubleshooting claims are intentionally not shown.</p></div></div></div></section><aside class="stage7-panel"><div class="stage7-panel-head"><div><h3>Browse topics</h3><p>Routes are available while article content is prepared.</p></div></div><div class="stage7-panel-body stage7-stack"><a class="stage7-link-row" asp-page="/Customer/Devices">Device setup <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a><a class="stage7-link-row" asp-page="/Customer/Monitoring">Monitoring and readings <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a><a class="stage7-link-row" asp-page="/Customer/Subscription">Billing and plans <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a><a class="stage7-link-row" asp-page="/Customer/Support/Create">Contact support <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div></aside></div>
<section class="stage7-panel stage7-faq-panel"><div class="stage7-panel-head"><div><h3>Common questions</h3><p>Official answers will be published after product review.</p></div></div><div class="stage7-panel-body"><div class="stage7-faq"><details><summary>Where can I register a device?</summary><p>Use the Add Device route once your authenticated device service is available.</p></details><details><summary>How do I review readings?</summary><p>Open Monitoring to view the integration-ready monitoring workspace. It does not claim live readings until a telemetry source is connected.</p></details><details><summary>How do I request help?</summary><p>Use Create Support Ticket to prepare a request. Submission remains unavailable until the support service is implemented.</p></details></div></div></section>
